### 1. 회원 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "홍길동",
  "email": "hong@example.com"
}

### 2. 전체 회원 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members

### 3. 회원 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/1

### 4. 검증 오류 확인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "invalid-email"
}
